Output docs/assets/demo/commands.gif

Hide
Type "./bin/sltty -demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

# The command line, then the settings panel.
Type ":theme nord"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type ":layout panels"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type ":find tools-team"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type ":clock 12h"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type ";"
Sleep 1s
Type "jjj"
Sleep 400ms
Type "lll"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Type "ll"
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type ":help"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
